      <p><seg source="#source-254-274">お馬がかへる</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-274-292"><rb>鑛山</rb><rt>やま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-292-309">からかへる</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-309-329">さくらの花を</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-329-348">鞍につけて</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-348-368">お馬がかへる</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-368-391">だまつてかへる</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-391-408">峠を越せば</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-408-423">影がながい</seg></p>
    </body>
